#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:59
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"GCompris is a multi-activity educational software. This documentation is for "
"the gcompris-teachers administration tool we provide."
msgstr ""
"GCompris d aseɣẓan asnedwal s mennaw n yirmad. Tasemlit-a d afecku n tedbelt "
"ara nmudd i yiselmaden n GCompris."

#. Tag: keyword
