msgstr "igerdan"

#. Tag: keyword
#: index.docbook:68
#, no-c-format
msgid "games"
msgstr "uraren"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Taskant"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:75
#, no-c-format
msgid "The goal of gcompris-teachers is to enable teachers to:"
msgstr "Iswi n gcompris n yiselmaden d asermed n yiselmaden i:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:79
#, no-c-format
msgid "create and manage pupils groups."
msgstr "snulfu, tesferkeḍ igrawen n yinelmaden."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:80
#, no-c-format
msgid "create specific work plans."
msgstr "rnu iɣawasen n umahil usdid."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:81
#, no-c-format
msgid "connect and send a work plan to pupils."
msgstr "qqen, syen azen aɣawas n umahil i yinelmaden."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:82
#, no-c-format
msgid "visualize the work results per group and pupil."
msgstr "senqed igmaḍ n umahil s yigrawen, s yinelmaden daɣen."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:83
#, no-c-format
msgid "analyse pupils answers."
msgstr "tasleḍt n tririyin n yinelmaden."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:87
#, no-c-format
msgid "Specifications"
msgstr "Tulmisin"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:88
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The following section describes the different screens implementing these "
"functionalities."
msgstr "Tafrant-a tgellem-d igdilen akk i yesɛan timahilin-a."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:93
#, no-c-format
msgid "Main screen overview"
msgstr "Taskant n ugdil agejdan"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:94
#, no-c-format
msgid "The main screen allows to access:"
msgstr "Agdil agejdan yessareg anekcum:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:98
#, no-c-format
msgid "Dashboard page."
msgstr "Asebter n tafelwit n usenqed."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:99
#, no-c-format
msgid "Manage pupils page."
msgstr "Sefrek Asebter n yinelmaden."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:100
#, no-c-format
msgid "Connect devices page."
msgstr "Asebter n tuqqna n yibenkan."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:101
#, no-c-format
msgid "Follow activities results page."
msgstr "Ḍfer asebter n yigmaḍ n yirmad."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:102
#, no-c-format
msgid "Manage datasets page."
msgstr "Sefrek asebter n yisefka."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:103
#, no-c-format
msgid "Display results as charts page."
msgstr "Sken-d igmaḍ d asebter s yidlifen."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:104
#, no-c-format
msgid "Settings page."
msgstr "Asebter n yiɣewwaren."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:106
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By default the Dashboard page is shown, containing the login dialog, and the "
"side menu bar to access the other pages is hidden until a teacher account is "
"logged in."
msgstr ""
"S wudem amezwer tafelwit n usenqed tettban-d, deg-s adiwenni n unekcum, "
"akked ufeggag n wumuɣ adisan i unekcum ɣer yisebtar niḍen i yeffren mi "
"yekcem umiḍan n uselmad."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:115
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The GCompris Teachers main screen showing the dashboard and login interface."
msgstr ""
"Agdil agejdan n GCompris n yiselmaden, yeskanay-d tafelwit n usenqed akked "
"ugruden n unekcum."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:119
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A button to show/hide the title of the buttons in the side menu bar (the "
"hamburger icon) allows to save some space once the user knows the meaning of "
"each icon."
msgstr ""
"Taqeffalt akken n sken/ffer azwel n tqeffalin yellan deg ufeggag n wumuɣ n "
"yidis (tignit n amburger), tessirig asekles n kra n tallunt ticki aseqdac "
"yessen anamek n yal tignit."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:127
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A view of the sidebar menu with the hamburger icon used to expand or "
"collapse the labels."
msgstr ""
"Udem n wumɣ n ufeggag adisa s tignit n umburger i yettwaseqdacen i usemɣer "
"neɣ i ufnaẓ n tebzimin."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:133
#, no-c-format
msgid "Dashboard - Login dialog"
msgstr "Tafelwit n usenqed - Adiwenni n unekcum"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:134
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To create a new teacher login and database, input the name and the password. "
"You’ll then be able to choose if you want to encrypt the database (to avoid "
"anyone to read it without the password)."
msgstr ""
"I tmerna n unekcum amaynut i uselmad d taffa n yisefka, sekcem isem d wawal "
"n uɛeddi. Syen ad tizmireḍ ad tferneḍ ma yella tebɣiḍ ad tewgelheḍ taffa n "
"yisefka (akken ur tettaǧǧaḍ ara albaɛḍ ad tt-iɣer war awal n uɛeddi)."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:143
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The dialog for creating a new teacher account with a username and password "
"and choosing database encryption settings."
msgstr ""
"Adiwenni i usnulfu n umiḍan amaynut n uselmad s yisem n useqdac d wawal n "
"uɛeddi, akked ufran n yiɣewwaren n uwgelhen i taffa n yisefka."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:149
#, no-c-format
msgid "Manage groups and pupils"
msgstr "Sefrek agrawen d yinelmaden"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:150
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This page allows to create the different pupils and groups for your class."
msgstr "Asebter-a yessirig asnulufu n yinelmaden d yigrawen i usmel."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:157
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The management screen where a teacher can view the list of groups and pupils."
msgstr "Agdil n usefrek anida ara iwali uselmad umuɣen n yigrawen d yinelmaden."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:162
#, no-c-format
msgid "Create a group"
msgstr "Snulfu-d agraw"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:163
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click on the <quote>Add a group</quote> button on the bottom left and in the "
"dialog fill the <quote>Name</quote> and optionally the <quote>Description</"
"quote>."
msgstr ""
"Sit ɣef <quote>Rnu agraw</quote> deg tqeffalt yellan ukessar ɣer tama "
"tazelmaḍt, deg udiwenni smed <quote>Isem</quote>, ternuḍ s wudem afrayan "
"<quote>Aglam</quote>."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:172
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The dialog box to add a new pupil group by entering its name and description."
msgstr ""
"Tabewwaḍt n udiwenni i tmerna n unelmad amaynut s usekcem n yisem-is d uglam-"
"is."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:178
#, no-c-format
msgid "Modify a group name or Delete it"
msgstr "Senfel isem n ugraw neɣ kkes-it"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:179
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To edit or delete a group, hover it on the group list and the <quote>Edit</"
"quote> and <quote>Delete</quote> buttons will appear."
msgstr ""
"I uẓrag neɣ tukksa n ugraw, saffeg-it ɣer wumuɣ n yigrawen syen tiqeffalin "
"<quote>Ẓreg</quote> akked <quote>Kkes</quote> ad d-banent."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:188
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The interface showing how edit and delete buttons appear when hovering over "
"a group name."
msgstr ""
"Agrudem-nni yesskanay-d amek i d-yettili ubeddel d tukksa n tqeffalin mi "
"yaffeg yisem n ugraw."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:192
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Clicking on the <quote>Delete</quote> button will allow you to delete the "
"group. Note that the pupils will be removed from the groups but not deleted "
"from the database. If you want to remove pupils, follow the next section."
msgstr ""
"Tussda ɣef tqeffalt <quote>Kkes</quote> ad tessireg tukksa n ugraw. Ẓer "
"belli inelmaden-a ad ttwakksen seg yigrawen maca ur ttwakkasen ara seg taffa "
"n yisefka. Ma yella tebɣiḍ ad tekkseḍ nelmaden, ḍfer tafrant tuḍfrt."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:202
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The confirmation prompt asking the teacher if they are sure they want to "
"delete a group."
msgstr ""
"Asentem-nni iɛeṭṭel yessuter deg yiselmaden ma yella d tidet bɣan ad kksen "
"agraw."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:208
#, no-c-format
msgid "Create a single pupil"
msgstr "Snulfu-d anelmad ayiwan"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:209
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click on <quote>Add a pupil</quote> to create a new pupil in the database. "
"There, you can set the pupil's name and the password to connect from the "
"clients. You can also directly add them in pre-existing groups."
msgstr ""
"Sit ɣef <quote>Rnu anelmad</quote> i wakken ad ternuḍ anelmad amaynut ɣer "
"taffa n yisefka. Din, tzemreḍ ad tesbaduḍ isem n unelmad akked wawal n "
"uɛeddi i wakken ad teqqneḍ seg yimsaɣen. Tzemreḍ daɣen ad t-ternuḍ srid deg "
"yigrawen i yellan yakan."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:218
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The 'Add a pupil' window showing fields for pupil name, password, and group "
"selection."
msgstr ""
"Asfaylu 'Rnu anelmad', yeskanay urtan i yisem n unelmad, awal n uɛeddi, "
"akked tefrant n ugraw."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:224
#, no-c-format
msgid "Create several pupils using csv strings / Export pupils to a file"
msgstr ""
"Rnu aṭas n yinelmaden s useqdec n yizegriren n csv / Kter inelmaden ɣer "
"ufaylu"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:226
#, no-c-format
msgid "You can directly import a list of pupils using a csv file."
msgstr "Tzemreḍ ad d-tketreḍ srid umuɣ n yinelmaden s useqdec n ufaylu csv."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:233
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The import interface used to upload multiple pupil profiles from a CSV file."
msgstr ""
"Agrudem n uktar i yettwaseqdacen i usali n yimaɣunen n yinelmaden seg ufaylu "
"CSV."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:237
#, no-c-format
msgid "Exporting a list of pupils is also possible:"
msgstr "Asifeḍ daɣen n wumuɣ n yinelmaden, iteddu:"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:243
#, no-c-format
msgid "pupil_export_csv"
msgstr "anelmad_sifeḍ_csv"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:249
#, no-c-format
msgid "Managing pupils"
msgstr "Asefrek n yinelmaden"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:250
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The interface also proposes buttons to edit pupils, add or remove them from "
"groups."
msgstr ""
"Agrudem yessutur daɣen tiqeffalin i uẓrag n yinelmaden, timerna d tukksa "
"nsen seg ugraw."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:257
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The interface showing the buttons used to assign a specific pupil to a "
"classroom group."
msgstr ""
"Agrudem yeskanay tiqeffalin i yettwaseqdacen i ujerred n unelmad uzzig deg "
"yiwen seg yirawen n usmel."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:264
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The interface showing how to remove a pupil from their currently assigned "
"group."
msgstr ""
"Agrudem yeskanay amek ara tekkseḍ anelmad seg ugraw ideg yettujered melmi "
"kan."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:268
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can also delete pupils. Note that deleting a pupil does not delete its "
"group."
msgstr ""
"Tzemreḍ daɣen ad tekkseḍ inelmaden. Ẓer kan, mi ara tekkseḍ anelmad ur "
"itekkes ara ugraw."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:275
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The pupil management screen highlighting the delete button for pupil "
"accounts."
msgstr ""
"Agdil n tukksa n yinelmaden, iremmed srid taqeffalt n tukksa n yimiḍanen-"
"nsen."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:282
#, no-c-format
msgid "Connect devices"
msgstr "Ibenk yettwaqqnen"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:283
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once the database is ready, it’s now time to communicate with the different "
"clients. The <quote>Connect devices</quote> page shows the different groups "
"and pupils. By default, no group is selected so all the pupils are visible. "
"Selecting a group will filter the visible pupils to only work with this "
"specific group."
msgstr ""
"Ma ifat tewjed taffa n yisefka, d lawan tura ad nemmeslɣu d yimsaɣen. "
"Asebtar <quote>Qqenibenkan</quote> yeskan-d igrawen d yinelmaden yemgaraden. "
"S wudem amezwer, ulac agraw i yettwafernen, inelmaden akk ad d-banen. Afran "
"n ugraw ad d-isbin kan inelmaden yellan deg-s."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:294
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The 'Connect devices' dashboard displaying the status of all available "
"pupils and groups."
msgstr ""
"Tafelwit n tuqqna \"Ibenkan yeqqnen\" yeskanay addaden n meṛṛa inelmaden d "
"yigrawen i yellan."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:299
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configuration of the server and client devices"
msgstr "Asesteb n uqeddac d yibenkan n yimsaɣen"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:300
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The teacher needs to configure the server and client devices they want to "
"connect to before being able to connect. All the devices need to be "
"connected on the same local network. On the server, go to the "
"<quote>Settings</quote> page and choose a unique <quote>Server ID</quote> "
"(at least unique for the local network) and a <quote>Port</quote> (if you "
"don’t know, keep the default one)."
msgstr ""
"Aselmad yesra ad issesteb aqeddac d yibenkan n yimsaɣen iyebɣan ad qqnen "
"uqbel ad izmiren ad qqnen. Akk ibenkan sran ad qqnen ɣer yiwen n uzeṭṭa "
"adigan. Deg uqeddac, ddu ɣer usebter <quote>Iɣewwaren</quote>, fren yiwen "
"kan <quote>Usulay n uqeddac</quote> (xerṣum yiwen uzeṭṭa adigan) akked "
"<quote>Tawwurt</quote> (ma ur t-teẓriḍ ara, ṭṭef deg umezwer)."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:311
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The settings page where the Server ID and Port number are configured for "
"network communication."
msgstr ""
"Asebter n yiɣewwaren anda asulay n uqeddac d uṭṭun n uwwur ttwassetben i "
"teywalt n uzeṭṭa."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:315
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"On GCompris devices side, go to the <quote>Configuration</quote> page from "
"the main menu, and scroll to the bottom to find the <quote>Teacher’s server "
"config</quote> button."
msgstr ""
"Ɣef yidis n yibenkan n GCompris, ddu ɣer usebter <quote>Asesteb</quote> seg "
"wumuɣ agejdan, syen drurem ɣer ukessar i wakken ad tafeḍ taqeffalt n <quote>"
"Sesteb aqeddac n uselmad</quote>."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:323
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A confirmation dialog on the pupil's device asking to connect to the "
"teacher's server."
msgstr ""
"Adiwenni n usentem ɣef yibenk n unelmad yessutur tuqqna ɣer uqeddac n "
"uselmad."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:327
#, no-c-format
msgid "After clicking it, make sure to have the same settings as the server:"
msgstr "Send tussda fell-as, ḍmen kifkif iɣewwaren akked uqeddac:"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:334
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The client-side settings screen where pupils enter the matching Server ID "
"and Port."
msgstr ""
"Agdil n yiɣewwaren n umsaɣ adisan anida inelmaden ssekcamen asulay n uqeddac "
"d tewwurt yemṣadan."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:338
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Also, if the device running the server or the client has a firewall, make "
"sure to open the chosen port in the firewall configuration to let the "
"devices communicate."
msgstr ""
"Daɣen, ma yella ibenk yessefrak aqeddac neɣ amsaɣ ɣur-s aɣrab n tmes, wali "
"ma teldi tewwurt i yettwafernen deg usesteb n uɣrab n tmes i wakken ibenkan "
"ad msawalen."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:345
#, no-c-format
msgid "Daily connection workflow"
msgstr "Tuqqna n wass"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:346
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The connection workflow is the following: <emphasis>The teacher asks the "
"pupils to switch on their devices and start GCompris, and then from the "
"<quote>Connect devices</quote> page press the <quote>Connect devices</quote> "
"button.</emphasis> On the client devices, a dialog will appear asking "
"confirmation to connect to the server. Note that client devices need to be "
"on the GCompris main menu, not on any activity or configuration page."
msgstr ""
"Tiddin n umahil n tuqqna d wa: <emphasis>Aselmad ad yessuter deg yinelmaden "
"ad ceɛlen, ad snekren GCompris, syen seg usebter <quote>Qqen ibenkan</quote> "
"sit ɣef tqeffalt <quote>Qqen ibenkan</quote>.</emphasis> Deg yibenkan n "
"yimsaɣen, ad d-iban udiwenni yessuturen asentem i tuqqna ɣer uqeddac. Ẓer "
"kan belli ibenkan ilaq ad ilin dg umuɣ agejdan n GCompris, mačči deg kra n "
"urmud neɣ deg usebter n usesteb."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:357
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A pop-up on the pupil's device asking for permission to connect to the "
"teacher's server."
msgstr ""
"Asfaylu udhim ɣef yibenk n unelmad yessutur tisirag i tuqqna ɣer uqeddac n "
"uselmad."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:361
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After confirmation from the pupils, the teacher selects which logins they "
"want to send from the <quote>Pupils</quote> list and press <quote>Send login "
"list</quote>"
msgstr ""
"Send asentem seg yinelmaden, aselmad ad yefren anwi inekcam i bɣan i tuzna "
"seg wumuɣ n <quote>Yinelmaden</quote> syen sit ɣef <quote>Azen umuɣ n "
"yinekcam</quote>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:365
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The client devices will display a new dialog allowing to select the login "
"they want."
msgstr ""
"Ibenkan n umsaɣ ad d-seknen adiwenni amaynut ara yessirgen afran n unekcum i "
"bɣan."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:372
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The login selection screen on the pupil device showing the list of names "
"sent by the teacher."
msgstr ""
"Agdil n tefrant n unekcum ɣef yibenk n unelmad yeskanay umuɣ n yismawen i "
"yettwaznen sɣur uselmad."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:376
#, no-c-format
msgid "Once confirmed, a second dialog will open to enter the password."
msgstr ""
"Ma ifat yettwasentem, adiwenni wis sin ad d-yeldi i usekcem n wawal n uɛeddi."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:382
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The password entry dialog on the pupil device for logging into their "
"specific profile."
msgstr ""
"Adiwenni n unekcum n wawal n uɛeddi ɣef yibenk n unelmad i unekcum ɣer "
"umaɣun-is uzzig."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:386
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If the password is correct, the client will see a green button on the bar "
"indicating a successful connection."
msgstr ""
"Awal n uɛeddi d ameɣtu, amsaɣ ad iwali taqeffalt tazegzawt deg ufeggag i d-"
"yeskanayen tuqqna yemmden."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:393
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The GCompris navigation bar showing a green indicator for a successful "
"server connection."
msgstr ""
"Afeggag n tunigin GCompris yeskanay anammal azegzaw i tuqqna n uqeddac "
"yeddan."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:397
#, no-c-format
msgid "And the server will receive a notification:"
msgstr "Syen aqeddac ad yeṭṭef alɣu:"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:403
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The teacher's dashboard showing color-coded status indicators for successful "
"and failed login attempts."
msgstr ""
"Tafelwit n usenqed yeskanay inammalen n waddad yettwastenglen s yini n "
"yineɛruḍen n tuqqna yeddan d tid yeccḍen."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:409
#, no-c-format
msgid "The different colors are:"
msgstr "Initen yemgarraden d wi:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:412
#, no-c-format
msgid "Green: connected"
msgstr "Azegzaw: yeqqen"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:413
#, no-c-format
msgid "Red: wrong password"
msgstr "Azzwwaɣ: yir awal n uɛeddi"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:414
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Grey: disconnected (it was connected at some point but got disconnected)"
msgstr "Iɣed: ur iqqin ara (yeqqen kra n teswiɛt maca yessenser)"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:416
#, no-c-format
msgid "Transparent: nobody tried to connect using this login."
msgstr "Afrawan: yiwen ur yeɛriḍ ad yeqqen s useqdec n unekcum-a."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:423
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The connection list displaying different colors for disconnected pupils "
"versus those who haven't yet connected."
msgstr ""
"Umuɣ n tuqqna yeskan-d initen yemgaraden i yinelmaden ur neqqin ara ɣer wid "
"mazal ur qqinen ara ar tura."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:430
#, no-c-format
msgid "Activities"
msgstr "Irmad"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:431
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This page allows to display the different results filtered by date, groups, "
"pupils and activities."
msgstr ""
"Asebter-a yessirig askan n yigmaḍ yemyezwaren s wazemz, s yigrawen, s "
"yinelmaden akked yirmad."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:438
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The activities results page showing filters for date, group, and specific "
"educational tasks."
msgstr ""
"Asebter n yigmaḍ n yirmad yeskanay imsizedgen n wazemz, n ugraw, akked "
"tmeskriyin n usedwel uzzig."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:442
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The following image shows the results for the <quote>Vertical subtraction</"
"quote> activity (each activity which handles sending data to the server has "
"its own visualisation)."
msgstr ""
"Tugna-a teskan-d igmaḍ i urmud n <quote>Tukksa tarakat</quote> (yal armud i "
"yessefraken tuzna n yisefka ɣer uqedac yesɛa udem-ines)."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:451
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A detailed breakdown of pupil performance in the 'vertical subtraction' "
"activity, showing errors and successes."
msgstr ""
"Tasleḍt talqayant i temellit n yinelmaden deg urmud n \"tukksa tubdit\", s "
"uskan n tuccḍiwin d usmures."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:455
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"We can see the pupil entered an incorrect answer on the first try and a "
"correct answer on the second try, and the answers details to spot the errors."
msgstr ""
"Nezmer ad nwali inelmaden i iskecmen tiririt tarameɣtut deg uneɛruḍ amezwaru "
"akked tririt tameɣtut deg uneɛruḍ wis sin, syen talqayt n tririyin i uslag n "
"tuccḍiwi."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:462
#, no-c-format
msgid "Datasets"
msgstr "Tigrummiwin n yisefka"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:463
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The datasets page allows teachers to create/update/delete specific datasets "
"for the activities to target specific needs, and send/remove them to/from "
"the clients."
msgstr ""
"Asebter n tegrumma n yisefka yettaǧǧa iselmaden ad d-snulfun/ad leqqmen/ad "
"kksen tagrumma n yisefka tuzzigin i yirmad i ubdar n kra n tallalt, daɣen ad "
"tt-aznen/ad tt-kksen ɣer/seg yimsaɣen."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:471
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The dataset management page where teachers create custom content for various "
"activities."
msgstr ""
"Asebter n usefrek n tegrumma n yisefka anda iselmaden snulfuyen-d agbur "
"uslig i waṭas n yirmad."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:475
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"One limitation for now is that only activities following the GCompris "
"dataset format can be edited (so no <quote>Grammatical classes</quote> or "
"<quote>Falling words</quote> for example). You can find the list of "
"supported activities (which can send data or have a dataset editor) on this "
"page of our development wiki: <ulink url=\"https://invent.kde.org/education/"
"gcompris/-/wikis/Teacher-administration-tool#supported-activities\"></ulink>"
msgstr ""
"Yiwet seg tlisa i yellan akka tura, slid irmad yeddan d umasal n tegrumma n "
"yisefkan CGcompris i izemren ad ttwaẓergen (ihi ulac <quote>Ismilen "
"inejrumen</quote> neɣ <quote>Awalen yeɣlin</quote> d amedya). Tzemreḍ ad "
"tafeḍ umuɣ i yirmad yettwasefraken (i izemren ad aznen isefka neɣ ad sɛun "
"amaẓrag n tegrumma n yisefka ɣef usebter-a n wiki-nneɣ n tneflit: <ulink "
"url=\"https://invent.kde.org/education/gcompris/-/wikis/Teacher-"
"administration-tool#supported-activities\"></ulink>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:483
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here is an example for the <quote>Binary bulbs</quote> activity. The common "
"part of all activity editors contains fields to enter the dataset name, the "
"goal and the difficulty. Then, each activity will have a specific editor."
msgstr ""
"Ha-t-a umedya ɣef urmud <quote>Binary bukbs</quote>. Aḥric yezdin akkirmad "
"deg-s urtan i usekcem isem n tagrumma n yisefka, iswi d wugul. Syen, yal "
"armud ad yesɛu amaẓrag i yiman-is."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:492
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The activity editor for 'Binary bulbs' activity, allowing customization of "
"dataset names and difficulty levels."
msgstr ""
"Amaẓrag n urmud i 'Binary bulbs', yessirig asagen n yismawen n tgrummiwin n "
"yisefka akked yiswiren i iweɛṛen."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:496
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <quote>Instructions</quote> button on the bottom left is provided to "
"give some specific information about how to fill the dataset when needed."
msgstr ""
"Taqeffalt <quote>Iwellihen</quote> deg tama tazelmaḍt ukessar yettmuddu-d "
"kra n talɣut ɣef wamek ara teččar tegrumma n yisefka ma yili ilaq."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:504
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The instructions panel providing guidance on how to correctly fill out "
"custom activity data."
msgstr ""
"Agalis n yiwellihen yettmuddu awelleh ɣef wamek ara yecččar akken iwata "
"isefka n urmud uslig."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:508
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you want to delete a dataset: select it, press the <quote>Remove dataset</"
"quote> button and confirm in the following dialog:"
msgstr ""
"Ma yella tebɣiḍ ad tekkseḍ isefka: ɣṛen-iten, sit ɣef taqeffalt <quote>Kkes "
"isefka</quote>, syen sentem aya deg udiwenni-a:"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:516
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The confirmation prompt used to safely delete a custom dataset from the "
"teacher tool."
msgstr ""
"Aneftaɣ n usentem i yettwasqedcen i tukksa s wudem aɣellsan tagrumma n "
"yisefak tudmawant seg ufecku n uselmad."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:520
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you have clients connected, you may want to send them a specific dataset "
"to be available on their side. Select the dataset and press the <quote>Send "
"to clients</quote> button. The list of all the connected clients will be "
"displayed and you will be able to select which will receive it."
msgstr ""
"Ma tesɛiḍ imsaɣen yeqqnen, ahat tebɣiḍ ad sen-tazneḍ tagrumma n yisefka "
"tudmawant ara yilin ɣur-sen.. Fren tagrumma n yisefka sakin sit ɣef tqeffalt "
"<quote>Azen i yemsaɣen</quote>. Umuɣ n yimsaɣen akk yeqqnen ad d-yettwaskan, "
"akken ad tizmireḍ ad tferneḍ anwa ara t-yeṭṭfen."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:530
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The interface for selecting which connected pupil devices should receive a "
"new dataset."
msgstr ""
"Agrudem i ufran n wanwi ibenkan n yinelmaden yeqqnen, yessefk ad d-yeṭṭef "
"tagrumma n yisefka tamaynut."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:535
#, no-c-format
msgid "Specific activities for the server"
msgstr "Irmad uzzigen i uqeddac"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:536
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"We have created the <quote>Multiple-choice questions</quote> activity that "
"is only visible when the device contains datasets for it. This activity "
"allows teachers to create multiple-choice questionnaires on any topic."
msgstr ""
"Terniḍ armud <quote>Multiple-choice questions</quote> ara d-ibanen kan deg "
"yibenk ideg llant tagrummiwin-ines n yisefka. Armud-a yessirig iselmaden ad "
"rnun isteqsiyen s waṭas n tririyin deg yal asentel."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:545
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The preview of the 'Multiple choice questions' activity on the pupil device."
msgstr "Taskant n urmud 'Tuttriwin s waṭas n tririyin' ɣef yibenk n unelmad."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:552
#, no-c-format
msgid "Charts"
msgstr "Idlifen"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:553
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Charts page is similar to the Activities page and allows to display the "
"different results filtered by date, groups, pupils and activities as charts."
msgstr ""
"Asebter n yidlifen yemṣada d usebter n yirmad yerna yessirig askan n yigmaḍ "
"yemgarraden yemyezwaren s wazemz, s yigrawen, s yinelmaden akked yirmad am "
"yidlifen."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:561
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The charts overview page providing a graphical visualization of pupil and "
"group progress."
msgstr ""
"Asebter n teskant n yidlifen yettmuddu-d tamuɣli n ukala n yinelmaden d "
"yigrawen."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:565
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For now, the visualization is really limited but will be improved depending "
"on teachers feedback. After clicking on an activity on the chart, there is a "
"view similar to what is shown on the Activities page. If the <quote>Pupils</"
"quote> tab is selected, you can see all the results for a specific pupil:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:576
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A graphical view showing the success rate and history for a specific pupil."
msgstr "Taskant n udlif teskanay afmiḍi n unekcum d uzray i unelmad uzzig."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:580
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If the <quote>Activities</quote> tab is selected, you can see all the "
"results for a specific activity:"
msgstr ""
"Ma yella tabzimt n <quote>Yirmad</quote> tettwafren, tzemreḍ ad twaliḍ akk "
"igmaḍ i kra n urmud:"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:588
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A chart displaying the overall class performance for a single selected "
"activity."
msgstr "Adlif yeskanay timlellit tamatut n usmil i yiwen urmud i yettwafernen."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:594
#, no-c-format
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Iɣewwaren"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:595
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The settings page allows to customize the interface and get some information "
"on the current database and session."
msgstr ""
"Asebter n yiɣewwaren yessirig asagen n ugrudem d wayyay n kra n yisalan ɣer "
"taffa n yisefka d tɣimit timiranin."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:603
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The general settings page showing information about the current session."
msgstr "Asebter n yiɣewwaren agejdan i yeskanayen talɣut ɣef tɣimit-a tamirant."

